.png", "id": "711899941319058", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821674_711899944652391_4944235026436662407_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=wlK7lms20nkQ7kNvwF0lYZT&_nc_oc=AdpN4I7txeWkcKHWVhnzk50cvddD6kjPwYrzjw9N4MH2meYYQSaRNfKcuVMGzyRgGjQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGDc98KruHN5gdORHuPofqB7L7Fo6uH6VVylx_KhJBFZA&oe=6A75E805"}, {"file_name": "29.png", "id": "1454224625646339", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821682_1454224628979672_3828715767483634636_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=LwHRPHiNpxYQ7kNvwFR4ArL&_nc_oc=AdoSAu3owN2IdVmVt0lzdfOg2AKlZDDIj_rT0sQXft3Hn_OunYHV965QPGuxjYFGrbc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHSRnk8_Rybp85mU_38xT0G9sjYFyxRekzJkwg4uQU2Vw&oe=6A75EDFE"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Cover Landscape (8).png", "id": "1909257480460371", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491824322_1909257487127037_4428719515585853534_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=PslFGGWkjgAQ7kNvwHyEpQC&_nc_oc=Adp-vp1peW2YjRVuYyTXjZUcyA1Yy1f9P7QoSoueporeIAhXc827X-ieINm6OTfhr-c&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHDkS1bfxNEi0v6h3FfCjU5y7cxlpWQnBRrr88pedKxWw&oe=6A75E0D6"}, "display_name": "Egg VR x Hero", "keywords": ["scary", "baboon", "dino", "hero", "fun"], "long_description": "**Run, climb, and jump in VR using a unique Baboon Movement inspired by Gorilla Tag.**\n\n# \ud83d\udd79\ufe0f Mini-Games \n\n**You can play different mini-games such as:**\n\n- **\ud83d\udc40 Squid Game**\n\n- **\ud83e\udd88 Steal a Monkey**\n\n- **\ud83d\udc7b Fun Horror Games**\n\n- **\ud83d\udc12 Hatch Egg**\n\n\n#  Steal a Brainrot\n\n**Steal Dino Brainrots and raise them and get rich**\n\n{2842365595962805}\n____________________________________________________________________.\n# \ud83d\udc7b Horror Mode\n\n**Run away from the Baboon Monster,  and fight against the boss**\n\n{851464257334354}\n\n____________________________________________________________________.\n#  \ud83e\udda0 Smash Mode\n\n**Tag Everyone and swing like a Gorilla or Baboon**\n\n{1317578033136114}\n____________________________________________________________________.\n#  \ud83e\udda0 Giant Mode\n{1554376978890768}\n____________________________________________________________________.\n# \ud83d\udd2b Shooter Mode\n\n**Play the best Rivals Shooter game**\n\n{25044154225189929}\n____________________________________________________________________.\n# \ud83d\udd2b NEW BOMBS and Mini Games\n\n**Get eggs and hatch them. Name and ride your chicken, snail, or your dino.**\n\n{4134103796903773}\n\n{1852341419024466}\n____________________________________________________________________.\n\nAnd try to survive in the new Forest in 99 nights, Egg VR 99 Nights Survive from Deer is Coming.\n\n# \ud83d\udd79\ufe0f Mini-Games \n\n**You can play different mini-games such as:**\n\n- **\ud83d\udc40 Squid Game**\n\n- **\ud83e\udd88 Steal a Monkey**\n\n- **\ud83d\udc7b Fun Monkey Horror Games**\n\n- **\ud83d\udc12 Egg Smash**\n\n\n# \ud83c\udf1f Become an Egg!\n\n", "short_description": "Become an Egg  Hero and play all the popular Minigames."}]}, "developer_name": "FutureOfVR", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://futureofvr.games/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "FutureOfVR", "support_website_url": "https://futureofvr.games/egg-vr/", "website_url": "https://futureofvr.games/egg-vr/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "3744040075834813"}, {"id": "528142316460358"}, {"id": "2710427532541308"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "1700921480735423"}, {"id": "1023770785722696"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": n